        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.webtoons.com/en/fantasy/the-top-dungeon-farmer/list?title_no=5656\">A guy gets isekai&rsquo;d</a> to the <del aria-hidden=\"true\">bottom</del> <em>top</em> floor of the dungeon, where he starts to level <del aria-hidden=\"true\">up</del> <em>fields</em> and grow <del aria-hidden=\"true\">stronger</del> <em>vegetables</em>. He meets a series of <del aria-hidden=\"true\">girls</del> <em>cute animals</em> most of whom wind up in love with <del aria-hidden=\"true\">him</del> <em>each other</em>, while he focuses on <del aria-hidden=\"true\">rescuing</del> <em>helping</em> the <del aria-hidden=\"true\">princess</del> <em>dragon</em> <del aria-hidden=\"true\">from the</del> <em>who is a</em> <del aria-hidden=\"true\">dragon</del> <em>princess</em>. It's <del aria-hidden=\"true\">a lot</del> <em>not quite</em> like I was expecting.<br/><br/>h/t <a href=\"https://www.metafilter.com/activity/93177/posts/mefi/\">Lorc</a> for getting me back over to Webtoon!",
