        "title": "Outer Space Treaties Didn’t Anticipate the Privatization of Space Travel. Can They Be Enforced?",
        "url": "https://psmag.com/social-justice/outer-space-treaties-didnt-anticipate-the-privatization-of-space-travel-can-they-be-enforced/",
        "content_text": "<p>If human civilization begins to expand into space, will colonists feel loyalty to their country, their planet, or Elon Musk?</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://psmag.com/social-justice/outer-space-treaties-didnt-anticipate-the-privatization-of-space-travel-can-they-be-enforced/\">Outer Space Treaties Didn&#8217;t Anticipate the Privatization of Space Travel. Can They Be Enforced?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://psmag.com\">Pacific Standard</a>.</p>",
