        "title": "Affordable iPhone accessories for CarPlay worth trying",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/24/affordable-iphone-accessories-for-carplay-worth-trying/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/best-carplay-apps.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CarPlay can make any vehicle feel significantly more comfortable and family. Still, the experience is not always perfect out of the box.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some cars still require a wired connection, others lack CarPlay entirely, and what about keeping your iPhone charged and cooled on long trips?</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fortunately, improving those areas doesn’t require a big investment. These affordable accessories cover everything from wireless CarPlay and MagSafe charging to cable management and complete displays for older vehicles.</p>",
