        "title": "AirPods Pro 3 and more just got new firmware release in beta",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/20/airpods-pro-3-and-more-just-got-new-firmware-release-in-beta/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/09/iphone-17-event-13.05.11.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has released new AirPods beta firmware today for developers and public beta testers. It’s available for AirPods Pro 3 and select other models. Here are the details.</p>",
        "type": "Technology",
