        "title": "Canada seeks performer for Eurovision 2027",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214262/Canada-seeks-performer-for-Eurovision-2027",
        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://cbc.radio-canada.ca/en/media-centre/eurovision-song-contest-2027-search-for-the-first-artist-to-represent-canada\">CBC/Radio-Canada launches the search for the first artist to represent Canada on the global stage.</a> CBC/Radio-Canada announced Monday that it will begin a nationwide search for an experienced musical performer to become the country's first representative at the Eurovision Song Contest, which will be held in Bulgaria next year.  More at the <a href=\"https://www.thestar.com/entertainment/music/canada-launches-search-for-first-eurovision-performer-as-fans-get-a-say-in-selection/article_578100e6-2d05-45f4-b00f-63959718b74a.html\">Toronto Star</a>.",
