        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/apple-store-ai-shopping.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last month, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/22/apple-store-app-may-soon-get-an-ai-powered-shopping-assistant/\">a report suggested</a> Apple was working on a new AI-powered shopping assistant for the Apple Store app on iPhone and iPad.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The company now appears to be rolling that out to <a href=\"https://x.com/VNchocoTaco/status/2091856604429947374\">select users</a> as part of an “Early Preview.”</p>",
