        "title": "AirTag 2 now just $20 each ahead of new feature coming soon",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/24/airtag-2-deal-best-price/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/airtag-2-radiating-sound.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last week delivered a collection of particularly notable price drops on current-generation Apple gear, from AirPods Pro 3 at <strong>25% off </strong>to the latest AirPods Max 2 at $120 off the list price, but we are not done yet. While those deals are indeed still live, Amazon has just delivered the lowest price ever on Apple’s 2026 AirTag 2 – you can now land them as low as $20 a pop. </p>",
