        "title": "iPadOS 27 adds three features to make iPad more like the Mac",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/21/ipados-27-adds-three-features-to-make-ipad-more-like-the-mac/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/ipados-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPadOS and macOS used to be very different software platforms. But especially since iPadOS 26, the two have become a lot more alike. And that’s even more true this year, with iPadOS 27 adding three features that make the iPad more Mac-like than ever.</p>",
