        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/homepad-ios-27-bg.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s new ‘HomePad’ smart home hub is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/10/apple-has-eight-new-products-to-unveil-at-september-event-report/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1064016\">reportedly</a> launching this fall, and the latest <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/19/homepad-code-suggests-itll-act-like-a-giant-apple-watch/\">leak</a> about it having customizable ‘faces’ offers another reason to put one in every room of your house.</p>",
