        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/12/iphone-17-black.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/19/apple-will-launch-10-new-products-soon-with-september-event-coming/\">big September event</a> is just weeks away, but there’s one key product that all reporting indicates will be missing: the base iPhone 18. Here’s when to expect its launch.</p>",
